### Additional Provisions & Design Rights Exclusion

The MIT License granted above applies exclusively to the technical software codebase, including:
1. Structural React & TypeScript code components.
2. The 3D WebGL (Three.js) math calculations, shader structures, and particle physics loops.
3. CSS styles and styling configurations.

**Excluded from the open-source license are:**
1. **The physical design creations**: The botanical yarn sculptures, flower stems, physical crochet wire armatures, stitch configurations, and bespoke textile ideas displayed on this website. These are proprietary handmade designs belonging to Kurush Yarn Atelier.
2. **Brand trademark assets**: The names "Kurush", "Kurush Yarn", "Kurush Yarn Atelier", and all corresponding custom visual logo marks or typography stamps.
3. **Media & Editorial Assets**: All high-definition photographs, video loops, textile stories, and portfolio product descriptions. These are fully copyrighted works under Kurush Yarn Atelier.

For inquiries about licensing physical designs or custom commercial design installations, please consult the Atelier desk at: kurushyarn@gmail.com
